    /**
     * Validate Exim configure file syntax.
     *
     * This function evaluates and validates an Exim configuration file's syntax.
     *
     * Documented: Available in cPanel & WHM 11 and later.
     *
     * Documented: Evaluates raw Exim configuration syntax. cfgText can contain secrets and uses SensitiveParameter;
     * even though upstream marks the operation read-only, this method uses form POST to keep text out of URLs. Omitted
     * cfgText analyzes the installed configuration; with section, supply only that section text. Validation is distinct
     * from eximConfigurationCheck(), which attempts repairs. Both invalid-configuration details and valid exim_caps
     * fields are retained; dynamic directive names map to strict integer 0/1 flags. No configuration change, restart,
     * retry or live syntax verification is established.
